{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/post/shi-er-zhang-zhao-pian--hui-gu-wo-de-2020-nian/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Xiaoxiong 日常","author":"Xiaoxiong"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"dbcb0257-78e9-5a73-98bd-ed2b6ae1b698","html":"<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 590px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/8ea78f2c8e724f2311c9b02b0622dd6d/b1ab4/IMG_6245.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 63.51351351351351%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"金泽-雨中兼六园\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/8ea78f2c8e724f2311c9b02b0622dd6d/1c72d/IMG_6245.jpg\"\n        srcset=\"/static/8ea78f2c8e724f2311c9b02b0622dd6d/a80bd/IMG_6245.jpg 148w,\n/static/8ea78f2c8e724f2311c9b02b0622dd6d/1c91a/IMG_6245.jpg 295w,\n/static/8ea78f2c8e724f2311c9b02b0622dd6d/1c72d/IMG_6245.jpg 590w,\n/static/8ea78f2c8e724f2311c9b02b0622dd6d/a8a14/IMG_6245.jpg 885w,\n/static/8ea78f2c8e724f2311c9b02b0622dd6d/fbd2c/IMG_6245.jpg 1180w,\n/static/8ea78f2c8e724f2311c9b02b0622dd6d/b1ab4/IMG_6245.jpg 3887w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span>\n一月，新年第一天，买了青春18车票去金泽旅行，七天时间走了金泽-富山-高山-神户-京都-名古屋，车很慢，相当累，收获了在路上的乐趣。</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 590px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/8cedcc26883f7d3fa6bcfd00b3c572f0/9568a/IMG_6590.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.1081081081081%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"市川站附近的樱花\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/8cedcc26883f7d3fa6bcfd00b3c572f0/1c72d/IMG_6590.jpg\"\n        srcset=\"/static/8cedcc26883f7d3fa6bcfd00b3c572f0/a80bd/IMG_6590.jpg 148w,\n/static/8cedcc26883f7d3fa6bcfd00b3c572f0/1c91a/IMG_6590.jpg 295w,\n/static/8cedcc26883f7d3fa6bcfd00b3c572f0/1c72d/IMG_6590.jpg 590w,\n/static/8cedcc26883f7d3fa6bcfd00b3c572f0/a8a14/IMG_6590.jpg 885w,\n/static/8cedcc26883f7d3fa6bcfd00b3c572f0/fbd2c/IMG_6590.jpg 1180w,\n/static/8cedcc26883f7d3fa6bcfd00b3c572f0/9568a/IMG_6590.jpg 3024w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span>\n二月，来东京三个多月，差不多稳定下来，开始考虑找房子。一个人跑到市川站附近，用吃力的日语和中介交流，看了几间都不太合适。第二天通过会中文的中介才找到合适的房子。天气虽然寒冷，有些樱花已经开了。</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 590px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/e881a7be7defa2ef50024b0839b6fb3a/7c971/IMG_6738.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.1081081081081%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"江户川附近的小路\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/e881a7be7defa2ef50024b0839b6fb3a/1c72d/IMG_6738.jpg\"\n        srcset=\"/static/e881a7be7defa2ef50024b0839b6fb3a/a80bd/IMG_6738.jpg 148w,\n/static/e881a7be7defa2ef50024b0839b6fb3a/1c91a/IMG_6738.jpg 295w,\n/static/e881a7be7defa2ef50024b0839b6fb3a/1c72d/IMG_6738.jpg 590w,\n/static/e881a7be7defa2ef50024b0839b6fb3a/a8a14/IMG_6738.jpg 885w,\n/static/e881a7be7defa2ef50024b0839b6fb3a/fbd2c/IMG_6738.jpg 1180w,\n/static/e881a7be7defa2ef50024b0839b6fb3a/7c971/IMG_6738.jpg 2818w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span>\n三月，临近搬家的时候，早上晨跑结束，发现附近的樱花已经冒尖了。这里真的挺好的，可惜太偏，上班不方便。</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 590px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/79be19d5fd4ed91f530084e4a31101ad/47311/IMG_6857.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 106.08108108108108%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"抄王刚师傅的懒人烧豆腐\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/79be19d5fd4ed91f530084e4a31101ad/1c72d/IMG_6857.jpg\"\n        srcset=\"/static/79be19d5fd4ed91f530084e4a31101ad/a80bd/IMG_6857.jpg 148w,\n/static/79be19d5fd4ed91f530084e4a31101ad/1c91a/IMG_6857.jpg 295w,\n/static/79be19d5fd4ed91f530084e4a31101ad/1c72d/IMG_6857.jpg 590w,\n/static/79be19d5fd4ed91f530084e4a31101ad/a8a14/IMG_6857.jpg 885w,\n/static/79be19d5fd4ed91f530084e4a31101ad/47311/IMG_6857.jpg 1080w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span>\n四月，搬新家一段时间了，生活逐渐安定下来。疫情依然严重，不敢出去吃饭，只好自己在家做。虽然不会做饭，但是咱会P图。</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 590px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/3204a889893c8da19f184e2cd94455a0/1de6e/%E8%B8%A2%E7%90%83%E8%B7%AF%E9%81%87%E5%B9%B3%E4%BA%95%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 50%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"平井公园附近的玫瑰花卉\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/3204a889893c8da19f184e2cd94455a0/1c72d/%E8%B8%A2%E7%90%83%E8%B7%AF%E9%81%87%E5%B9%B3%E4%BA%95%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD.jpg\"\n        srcset=\"/static/3204a889893c8da19f184e2cd94455a0/a80bd/%E8%B8%A2%E7%90%83%E8%B7%AF%E9%81%87%E5%B9%B3%E4%BA%95%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD.jpg 148w,\n/static/3204a889893c8da19f184e2cd94455a0/1c91a/%E8%B8%A2%E7%90%83%E8%B7%AF%E9%81%87%E5%B9%B3%E4%BA%95%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD.jpg 295w,\n/static/3204a889893c8da19f184e2cd94455a0/1c72d/%E8%B8%A2%E7%90%83%E8%B7%AF%E9%81%87%E5%B9%B3%E4%BA%95%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD.jpg 590w,\n/static/3204a889893c8da19f184e2cd94455a0/a8a14/%E8%B8%A2%E7%90%83%E8%B7%AF%E9%81%87%E5%B9%B3%E4%BA%95%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD.jpg 885w,\n/static/3204a889893c8da19f184e2cd94455a0/fbd2c/%E8%B8%A2%E7%90%83%E8%B7%AF%E9%81%87%E5%B9%B3%E4%BA%95%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD.jpg 1180w,\n/static/3204a889893c8da19f184e2cd94455a0/1de6e/%E8%B8%A2%E7%90%83%E8%B7%AF%E9%81%87%E5%B9%B3%E4%BA%95%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD.jpg 5213w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span>\n五月，在家办公快三个月，自己的业余项目又忙了整整两个礼拜，憋太久了，约同事去踢球的路上拍到了漂亮的图片，从此发现了拍照的乐趣，不管去哪都会带着相机，也学会了做基本的后期处理。</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 590px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/94534e7087b4a1bb6910580c253d2f36/eaea0/001-4.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 177.7027027027027%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"东京塔\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/94534e7087b4a1bb6910580c253d2f36/1c72d/001-4.jpg\"\n        srcset=\"/static/94534e7087b4a1bb6910580c253d2f36/a80bd/001-4.jpg 148w,\n/static/94534e7087b4a1bb6910580c253d2f36/1c91a/001-4.jpg 295w,\n/static/94534e7087b4a1bb6910580c253d2f36/1c72d/001-4.jpg 590w,\n/static/94534e7087b4a1bb6910580c253d2f36/a8a14/001-4.jpg 885w,\n/static/94534e7087b4a1bb6910580c253d2f36/fbd2c/001-4.jpg 1180w,\n/static/94534e7087b4a1bb6910580c253d2f36/eaea0/001-4.jpg 2945w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span>\n六月，解锁了拍照的乐趣后就一发不可收拾，下班后去逛公园还不满足，利用周末转遍了皇居，东京塔，晴空塔等东京市内的地标建筑。</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 590px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/2b7ad7715d8ec9f7fb84f660cec405bc/b693b/P1010749.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.08108108108109%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"烟雾缭绕的饭能河源\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/2b7ad7715d8ec9f7fb84f660cec405bc/1c72d/P1010749.jpg\"\n        srcset=\"/static/2b7ad7715d8ec9f7fb84f660cec405bc/a80bd/P1010749.jpg 148w,\n/static/2b7ad7715d8ec9f7fb84f660cec405bc/1c91a/P1010749.jpg 295w,\n/static/2b7ad7715d8ec9f7fb84f660cec405bc/1c72d/P1010749.jpg 590w,\n/static/2b7ad7715d8ec9f7fb84f660cec405bc/a8a14/P1010749.jpg 885w,\n/static/2b7ad7715d8ec9f7fb84f660cec405bc/fbd2c/P1010749.jpg 1180w,\n/static/2b7ad7715d8ec9f7fb84f660cec405bc/b693b/P1010749.jpg 5394w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span>\n七月，工作负担开始变重，生活也不再有新鲜感，那段时间过得比较痛苦，月末的一个连休，约同事去爬山散散心，被拒绝了。只好一个人去了饭能，《向山进发》的取景地。爬到半山开始下雨，山里一个人都没有，担惊受怕中完成了接下来的行程。</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 590px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/e0cf3ca1b6474ba948bee75a631c2a96/d2602/005.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 72.97297297297297%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"筑波-东京大巴上的望天\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/e0cf3ca1b6474ba948bee75a631c2a96/1c72d/005.jpg\"\n        srcset=\"/static/e0cf3ca1b6474ba948bee75a631c2a96/a80bd/005.jpg 148w,\n/static/e0cf3ca1b6474ba948bee75a631c2a96/1c91a/005.jpg 295w,\n/static/e0cf3ca1b6474ba948bee75a631c2a96/1c72d/005.jpg 590w,\n/static/e0cf3ca1b6474ba948bee75a631c2a96/a8a14/005.jpg 885w,\n/static/e0cf3ca1b6474ba948bee75a631c2a96/fbd2c/005.jpg 1180w,\n/static/e0cf3ca1b6474ba948bee75a631c2a96/d2602/005.jpg 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span>\n八月，戒掉了玩了两个月的手游，恢复了作息，晨起跑步，傍晚节食，生活开始有了掌控感。月初一个人去爬了筑波山，月中送离职的同事回台湾，月底和同事去了江之岛。</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 590px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/ed7b4d6fdd4b817a32e1c72047995ba5/d2b5b/IMG_8074.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 54.05405405405405%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"琵琶湖白须神社鸟居\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/ed7b4d6fdd4b817a32e1c72047995ba5/1c72d/IMG_8074.jpg\"\n        srcset=\"/static/ed7b4d6fdd4b817a32e1c72047995ba5/a80bd/IMG_8074.jpg 148w,\n/static/ed7b4d6fdd4b817a32e1c72047995ba5/1c91a/IMG_8074.jpg 295w,\n/static/ed7b4d6fdd4b817a32e1c72047995ba5/1c72d/IMG_8074.jpg 590w,\n/static/ed7b4d6fdd4b817a32e1c72047995ba5/a8a14/IMG_8074.jpg 885w,\n/static/ed7b4d6fdd4b817a32e1c72047995ba5/fbd2c/IMG_8074.jpg 1180w,\n/static/ed7b4d6fdd4b817a32e1c72047995ba5/d2b5b/IMG_8074.jpg 1387w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span>\n九月，开始迷恋看电影，每个周末都会顶着疫情和日语的压力去看电影。月底借着四连休请假去滋贺，实现几年前环琵琶湖的愿望。三天骑行220公里，东京-岐阜-大垣-米原环湖开始-高岛-大津-丰乡-米原环湖结束-京都-宇治-东京，满足，且累的够呛。</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 590px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/62d27a4fd3d8fc7a9cfc712c413e2715/dc621/%E4%BD%83%E5%B0%8F%E6%A1%A5.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.75675675675676%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"月岛-佃小桥\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/62d27a4fd3d8fc7a9cfc712c413e2715/1c72d/%E4%BD%83%E5%B0%8F%E6%A1%A5.jpg\"\n        srcset=\"/static/62d27a4fd3d8fc7a9cfc712c413e2715/a80bd/%E4%BD%83%E5%B0%8F%E6%A1%A5.jpg 148w,\n/static/62d27a4fd3d8fc7a9cfc712c413e2715/1c91a/%E4%BD%83%E5%B0%8F%E6%A1%A5.jpg 295w,\n/static/62d27a4fd3d8fc7a9cfc712c413e2715/1c72d/%E4%BD%83%E5%B0%8F%E6%A1%A5.jpg 590w,\n/static/62d27a4fd3d8fc7a9cfc712c413e2715/a8a14/%E4%BD%83%E5%B0%8F%E6%A1%A5.jpg 885w,\n/static/62d27a4fd3d8fc7a9cfc712c413e2715/fbd2c/%E4%BD%83%E5%B0%8F%E6%A1%A5.jpg 1180w,\n/static/62d27a4fd3d8fc7a9cfc712c413e2715/dc621/%E4%BD%83%E5%B0%8F%E6%A1%A5.jpg 5404w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span>\n十月，旅游后综合征，干什么都打不起精神。更新了签证，看了鬼灭之刃的剧场版，看了堀口悠纪子的原画展，去月岛故地重游，买了XGP会员，买了一个小沙发，开始玩微软模拟飞行，开始沉迷手办和拍塑料小人。</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 590px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/c1e6a5575600b40623b966ead3816797/d93a2/IMG_8480.MOV_20201231_185948.599.jpg\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 56.08108108108109%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/jpeg;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"箱根仙石原芒草原\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/c1e6a5575600b40623b966ead3816797/1c72d/IMG_8480.MOV_20201231_185948.599.jpg\"\n        srcset=\"/static/c1e6a5575600b40623b966ead3816797/a80bd/IMG_8480.MOV_20201231_185948.599.jpg 148w,\n/static/c1e6a5575600b40623b966ead3816797/1c91a/IMG_8480.MOV_20201231_185948.599.jpg 295w,\n/static/c1e6a5575600b40623b966ead3816797/1c72d/IMG_8480.MOV_20201231_185948.599.jpg 590w,\n/static/c1e6a5575600b40623b966ead3816797/a8a14/IMG_8480.MOV_20201231_185948.599.jpg 885w,\n/static/c1e6a5575600b40623b966ead3816797/fbd2c/IMG_8480.MOV_20201231_185948.599.jpg 1180w,\n/static/c1e6a5575600b40623b966ead3816797/d93a2/IMG_8480.MOV_20201231_185948.599.jpg 1868w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 590px) 100vw, 590px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span>\n十一月，公司业绩下滑，每周多了一个休息日，有些担心但是没做更多准备。去了箱根EVA圣地巡礼，逛博物馆。抢购的 Xbox 主机到了开始沉迷游戏，也开始担忧下个月的日语等级考试，试图恢复作息，但失败了。</p>\n<p><img src=\"./images/20201218-P1020468-2_1.jpg\" alt=\"秋田站前-下雪\">\n十二月，临时抱佛脚准备N3考试，恰逢新功能上线，忙的昏天暗地。定了东北的新干线之旅，东京-新泻-秋田-大馆-宏前-青森-东京，见到了心心念念的大雪。本想就这样给今年画上一个完美的句号，没想到陷入了巨大的职业危机。</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"十二张照片，回顾我的2020年","date":"2020-12-31 12:31"}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/post/shi-er-zhang-zhao-pian--hui-gu-wo-de-2020-nian/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["3868140423"],"slicesMap":{}}